<%-
  # Shown on the session card once the session has ended.
  # Master copy: .github/ood-checks/completed.md.erb (sync.sh copies it into each app).
  err = staged_root.join("ood_error.md")
  log = staged_root.join("output.log")
  tail = begin
    log.file? ? File.open(log) { |f| f.seek([f.size - 200_000, 0].max); f.read } : ""
  rescue StandardError
    ""
  end
-%>
<%- if err.file? && err.size > 0 -%>
<%= err.read %>
<%- elsif tail =~ /oom[-_ ]kill|out of memory/i -%>
#### The session ran out of memory

It needed more memory than was requested in the form, so Slurm stopped it. Launch it again with more *Memory*.
<%- elsif tail =~ /DUE TO TIME LIMIT/ -%>
#### The session reached its time limit

Slurm ended it when the requested hours ran out. Save your work regularly, and ask for more *hours* next time.
<%- end -%>
